{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CLLocationDirection"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"north. The value "},{"code":"90","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value "},{"code":"180","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to animate the change, use the "},{"code":"-setDirection:animated:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/direction"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView(py)direction","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/io